(property "Description" "Phoenix Contact MSTBA 2,5/3-G-5,08 — 3-pin 5.08 mm pitch pluggable terminal block base (PCB-side header). 24 V supply input: pin 1 = +24V_unprotected, pin 2 = GND, pin 3 = PE. Mates with a Phoenix COMBICON 5.08 mm 3-pin plug; the user-removable plug accepts solid or stranded 0.2-2.5 mm² conductors. Order code 1757255 (12 A) or 1923872 (16 A HC)."
