(property "Description" "LM2596S-5.0 5 V 3 A asynchronous step-down buck (TI), TO-263-5. v0.50-routing-rework: hand-placed in KiCad — rotated 180° and shifted ~3 mm west to (-38.03, -34.014) to relieve buck fan-out congestion. The 180° flip points the 5-lead row east toward the ESP32 fan-out zone; the compensating westward shift keeps the body clear of the LD2410 east edge."
