(property "Description" "100 nF local decoupling for LD2410 (J4 pin 5 / +5V). v0.45: vertical, placed at the 11-o'clock of J4's west end — west of the LD2410 body (LDR1, X>=97.4) in open copper. Nudged 0.5 mm north of the v0.44 spot (Y +14.5 -> +14.0) — the v0.44 position left C11.1 only 2.98 mm from the nearest J4 THT pad (JLCDFM 'tht to smd' warning); +0.5 mm lifts that to ~3.4 mm, clear of the >3.05 mm rule. North field is open (no neighbour within 4 mm)."
